{"request":{"publicParam":[{"requestName":"method","mustNeed":true,"type":2,"style":1,"example":"order.logisticsAdd","description":"调用的API接口名称"},{"requestName":"app_key","mustNeed":true,"type":2,"style":1,"example":"6839996111118329223","description":"应用创建完成后被分配的key"},{"requestName":"access_token","mustNeed":true,"type":2,"style":1,"example":"edae7c30-8386-443b-88a1-031111596fdd","description":"用于调用 API 的 access_token","hiddenForInterfaceName":["/token/create"]},{"requestName":"param_json","mustNeed":true,"type":2,"style":1,"example":"{cid:12,page:1}","description":"标准json类型，里面是业务参数按照参数名的字符串大小排序具体参数值，参考每个接口的参数表"},{"requestName":"timestamp","mustNeed":true,"type":2,"style":1,"example":"2020-09-15 14:48:13","description":"时间戳，格式为yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss，时区为GMT+8，例如：2016-01-01 12:00:00"},{"requestName":"v","mustNeed":true,"type":2,"style":1,"example":"2","description":"API协议版本，当前版本为2"},{"requestName":"sign","mustNeed":true,"type":2,"style":1,"example":"796559d40beb08a1a1113c456c5c5a62","description":"输入参数签名结果，签名算法参照 [API调用指南](https://op.jinritemai.com/docs/guide-docs/10/23)"},{"requestName":"sign_method","mustNeed":false,"type":2,"style":1,"example":"hmac-sha256","description":"签名算法类型推荐使用hmac-sha256后续会下线md5（不传则默认为"md5"）1. md5:表示用md5算法加密字符串 2. hmac-sha256:表示用hmac_sha_256算法加密字符串"}],"requestParam":[{"requestName":"order_id","toName":"OrderId","mustNeed":true,"type":2,"style":1,"example":"4782813149182887526","description":"订单ID","cipherTextType":1},{"requestName":"logistics_id","toName":"LogisticsId","mustNeed":false,"type":1,"style":1,"example":"1","description":"【已废弃】物流公司ID。请使用company_code字段。","cipherTextType":1},{"requestName":"company","toName":"Company","mustNeed":false,"type":2,"style":1,"example":"顺丰公司","description":"物流公司名称","cipherTextType":1},{"requestName":"company_code","toName":"CompanyCode","mustNeed":false,"type":2,"style":1,"example":"shunfeng、qita","description":"(必填)物流公司code,可从/order/logisticsCompanyList接口获取。","cipherTextType":1},{"requestName":"logistics_code","toName":"LogisticsCode","mustNeed":false,"type":2,"style":1,"example":"sf1231231231234","description":"(必填)快递单号","cipherTextType":1},{"requestName":"is_refund_reject","toName":"IsRefundReject","mustNeed":false,"type":4,"style":1,"example":"false","description":"是否拒绝退款申请（true表示拒绝退款，并继续发货；不传或为false表示有退款需要处理，拒绝发货），is_refund_reject和is_reject_refund随机使用一个即可","cipherTextType":1},{"requestName":"is_reject_refund","toName":"IsRefundReject","mustNeed":false,"type":4,"style":1,"example":"false","description":"是否拒绝退款申请（true表示拒绝退款，并继续发货；不传或为false表示有退款需要处理，拒绝发货），is_refund_reject和is_reject_refund随机使用一个即可","cipherTextType":1},{"requestName":"serial_number_list","toName":"SerialNumberList","mustNeed":false,"type":3,"subType":2,"style":1,"example":"["123"]","description":"商品序列号，15-17位数字","cipherTextType":1},{"requestName":"address_id","toName":"AddressId","mustNeed":false,"type":1,"style":1,"example":"6","description":"发货地址ID,通过地址库列表【/address/list】接口查询","cipherTextType":1},{"requestName":"store_id","toName":"StoreId","mustNeed":false,"type":1,"style":1,"example":"111523","description":"门店ID；抖超小时达店铺需要填写；","cipherTextType":1},{"requestName":"after_sale_address_id","toName":"AftersaleAddressId","mustNeed":false,"type":1,"style":1,"example":"1","description":"退货地址ID,通过地址库列表【/address/list】接口查询。当传入该字段时，可实现自动审核场景买家退货至商家指定退货地址：例如商家配置的售后小助手以及平台闪电退货规则，会获取发货时传入的after_sale_address_id地址id对应的地址给买家展示进行商品退回；","cipherTextType":1},{"requestName":"product_orders","toName":"ProductOrders","mustNeed":false,"type":3,"subType":5,"style":1,"example":"","description":"挂在商品单上的信息，只是用于传递和商品单关联的信息，比如SN/69/IMEI码。目前接口还是按照店铺单维度推进发货状态，不会按照传递过来的product_order_id推进订单状态。比如，店铺单下有A、B、C三个商品单，其中A单需要SN/69/IMEI码，这时候只需要把A单关联的SN/69/IMEI传递过来即可。接口会把A、B、C三个商品单都推进到已发货状态。","cipherTextType":1,"children":[{"requestName":"serial_no_list","toName":"SerialNosList","mustNeed":false,"type":3,"subType":5,"style":1,"example":"","description":"需要的SN/69/IMEI码列表。","cipherTextType":1,"children":[{"requestName":"value","toName":"Value","mustNeed":false,"type":3,"subType":2,"style":1,"example":"["12343"]","description":"SN/69/IMEI码的值。","cipherTextType":1},{"requestName":"key","toName":"Key","mustNeed":false,"type":2,"style":1,"example":"SN","description":"SN/69/IMEI码的类型
对于空调国补，内机SN对应SN_INDOOR，外机SN对应SN_OUTDOOR","cipherTextType":1}]},{"requestName":"product_order_id","toName":"ProductOrderId","mustNeed":false,"type":2,"style":1,"example":"4782813149182887526","description":"商品单单号","cipherTextType":1}]},{"requestName":"trace_info_list","toName":"TraceInfoList","mustNeed":false,"type":3,"subType":5,"style":1,"example":"","description":"【注意！目前仅「即时零售」业务使用！！！】溯源码list，多个sku放一起，用内部的sku_order_id区分,举个例子，假设你有3个sku，你就创建一个list，长度为3，list里面每一个元素都是一个sku维度，用sku_order_id区分，其中，每一个sku的信息，里面是可以传多个批次和溯源码的，具体看你需要传几个，你就在batch_and_trace_code_list里面传几个；","cipherTextType":1,"children":[{"requestName":"batch_and_trace_code_list","toName":"BatchAndTraceCodeList","mustNeed":false,"type":3,"subType":5,"style":1,"example":"","description":"溯源码详情","cipherTextType":1,"children":[{"requestName":"trace_code","toName":"TraceCode","mustNeed":false,"type":2,"style":1,"example":""123"","description":"溯源码","cipherTextType":1},{"requestName":"batch_code","toName":"BatchCode","mustNeed":false,"type":2,"style":1,"example":""123"","description":"批次号","cipherTextType":1}]},{"requestName":"sku_order_id","toName":"SkuOrderId","mustNeed":false,"type":2,"style":1,"example":""123"","description":"sku单id","cipherTextType":1}]}]},"response":{},"demo":{"requestDemo":{"curl":{"reqUrl":"https://openapi-fxg.jinritemai.com?app_key=your_appkey_here&method=&access_token=your_accesstoken_here&param_json={}&timestamp=2018-06-19%2016:06:59&v=2&sign=your_sign_here"},"java":{"code":"OrderLogisticsAddRequest request = new OrderLogisticsAddRequest();
